    <string name="other_beta">Beta</string>
    <string name="other_read">Ufuq reads the title and progress of ongoing notifications, such as a ride, a delivery, a timer or a download, from the apps you choose.</string>
    <string name="other_not_read">It does not read messages, chats or any other notification, and ignores apps you have not chosen, media (shown separately) and calls.</string>
    <string name="other_stored">Nothing is stored or sent. Ufuq has no internet access and keeps only the list of apps you chose.</string>
    <string name="other_choose">This uses Android’s notification access, the same permission the media page needs. After you grant it, tick the apps to show in Settings. You can turn it off any time.</string>
